l916.com/skinVideo/50001/3073/307303/技能1 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3073/307303/技能2.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3073/307303/技能2 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3073/307303/大招.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3073/307303/大招 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3073/307303/入场.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3073/307303/入场 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">“波茨人～！正义勇敢的电子英雄，波茨人～！”<br />这是电子游戏风头正盛的年代，无数游戏角色成为了孩童们心目中的偶像。其中人气最高的，便是《电子英雄波茨人》。<br />“能够一步跃上10米高的平台，拳头可以积蓄能量打出电光拳，波茨人真的太厉害了！我也好想变得像他一样～！”<br />拉普拉斯科算中心承担了圣诞老人的职责。研究人员把废旧电烤箱改造成可穿戴头盔，用真空管打造了一副可以变形的手套。他们甚至偷偷使用了科算中心的相关机密技术，制造出真正的火箭背包。似乎在游戏面前，科研机构的工作人员也不过是另一群孩子而已。<br />当许下愿望的孩童穿上这些礼物的瞬间，虚拟屏幕中的超级英雄便来到了现实世界之中。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"307303\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-307304.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/21/Belonging-307304.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">全频段可穿戴烤箱<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Modified Oven\" Helmet</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />1.23<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>从废旧品卖场中淘来的，一台造型奇特的电烤箱。拉普拉斯的研究人员根据涂画在笔记本上的设计对其进行了改造，戴上便会“充满力量”。<br />据受访者所说，设计灵感来自某位人气极高的电子游戏角色。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-307305.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/6a/Belonging-307305.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\"><div class=\"line-1\">“波茨”火箭背包&amp;\n</div><div class=\"line-2\">高纯度便携能量</div><div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Giga Girl\" Jetpack &amp; Energy Canister</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />4.56<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>以该游戏角色的名字命名的火箭背包。相关技术沿用自某位飞艇船长持有的设备，并利用便携能量罐提高动力，实现全面升级。<br />“尽管只是孩童的嬉戏，但十分有趣，就连我们都不禁沉迷其中！”拉普拉斯的研究人员对制作过程作出如此评价。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-307306.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/61/Belonging-307306.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\"><div class=\"line-1\">多功能穿戴玩具\n</div><div class=\"line-2\">“波茨炮”</div><div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Giga Cannon\" Toy Gauntlets</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />7.8<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>使用真空管改造而成的拉普拉斯制品。通过弹簧与按压组件的精妙组合，可以实现完全的变形功能。<br />这款玩具具有炮管的造型，但根据拉普拉斯科算中心对孩童用品的定义，“它并不具备任何杀伤力”。</div></div></div></div></div><div id=\"全新语音\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.85.A8.E6.96.B0.E8.AF.AD.E9.9F.B3_New_Voice\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"全新语音_New_Voice\">全新语音<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">New Voice</span></small></span></h2><div><table class=\"wikitable responsive voice-table\" style=\"margin:0; --size: 23px; width:100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"hide-m\" style=\"vertical-align:middle\"><td style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"Tupo xindiantu.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Tupo_xindiantu.png/107px-Tupo_xindiantu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"107\" height=\"30\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Tupo_xindiantu.png/161px-Tupo_xindiantu.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Tupo_xindiantu.png/